        "chapterId": 24,
        "headingId": 765,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>8091/3 Superficial basal cell carcinoma</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-24T14:30:33"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 823,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "ICD-11 coding",
    "headingPosition": 3,
    "headingid": 766,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 124414,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 24,
        "headingId": 766,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>2C32.2 Superficial basal cell carcinoma of skin</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-24T14:30:33"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 824,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Related terminology",
    "headingPosition": 4,
    "headingid": 767,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 124415,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 24,
        "headingId": 767,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Not recommended:</em> superficial multifocal basal cell carcinoma; superficial multicentric basal cell carcinoma.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-24T14:30:33"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 825,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Subtype(s)",
    "headingPosition": 5,
    "headingid": 768,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 124416,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 24,
        "headingId": 768,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-24T14:30:33"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 826,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 769,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 124417,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 24,
        "headingId": 769,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Superficial BCC occurs most frequently on the trunk and limbs and accounts for 10&ndash;30% of BCCs.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-24T14:30:33"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 827,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 770,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 124418,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 24,
        "headingId": 770,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Superficial BCC is characterized by erythematous, often annular, mildly scaly patches with rolled borders, ranging from 1&ndash;2&nbsp;mm to &gt;&nbsp;100&nbsp;mm in diameter {30741348}. Dermoscopy most often reveals short fine telangiectasia, multiple small erosions, and shiny white structures {31706938}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-24T14:30:33"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 828,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 771,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 124419,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 24,
        "headingId": 771,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>See the family description (<a style=\"cursor:pointer\" href=\"/chaptercontent/64/22\" target=\"_blank\">section </a><em>Basal cell carcinomas</em>).</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-24T14:30:33"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 829,
    "bookid": 64,
